==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Etymology===
The English form of {{der|en|la|Dorothea}}, the name of a legendary saint, from {{der|en|grc|Δωροθέα}}, from {{m|grc|δῶρον|t=gift}} + {{m|grc|θεός|t=god}}.

